# Nothing derived from a copyrighted game is ever committed here. What lives in
# this repository is addresses, structure and prose: control files, ref files
# and the scripts that turn a tape into a disassembly. Run one and it produces
# the game's bytes locally, under game_disassembly/, which stays out of git.
game_disassembly/

# Game tapes and snapshots. Supply your own.
*.tap
*.tzx
*.sna
*.z80
*.szx

# The Spectrum ROM (copyright Amstrad, freely distributable for emulation but
# not ours to redistribute here).
roms/*
!roms/.gitkeep

# Fetched build tool (github.com/z00m128/sjasmplus).
tools/sjasmplus/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv*/
